Description: Accept mashumaro >= 3.15
 Upstream raised the floor from 3.14 to 3.20 in the commit adding Python 3.14
 support (8840fc395e), without code that needs it. Ubuntu 26.04 and 26.10
 ship mashumaro 3.17 and the PPA backports 3.15 to 24.04. The full test suite
 passes against 3.17 on Python 3.14 and against 3.15 on Python 3.12.
Author: Robert August Vincent II (Bob) <pillarsdotnet@gmail.com>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-02
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@ dependencies = [
   "cryptography>=1.9",
   "aiohttp>=3",
   "tzdata>=2024.2 ; platform_system == 'Windows'",
-  "mashumaro>=3.20"
+  "mashumaro>=3.15"
 ]
 
